# Default deny. Only the reviewed public surface is allowlisted.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!SECURITY.md
!SUPPORT.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md

!docs/
docs/*
!docs/BETA-TESTING.md
!docs/VERIFY-DOWNLOAD.md
!docs/PRIVACY-AND-REDACTION.md

!keys/
keys/*
!keys/nulx-release-public-key.asc

!.github/
.github/*
!.github/CODEOWNERS
!.github/pull_request_template.md
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/*
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug-report.yml
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/installation-report.yml
!.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/hardware-compatibility.yml
!.github/workflows/
.github/workflows/*
!.github/workflows/public-boundary.yml
